    Non-Votes</b></span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: bottom; background-color: #CCEEFF">
    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; white-space: nowrap; text-align: center; width: 23%"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt; color: #212529">6,777,054</span></td>
